r\n<section class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-100\">\r\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center text-white\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-16 italic text-gray-900\">Serving Rajpipla City &amp; Narmada Hubs</h2>\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 text-left\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-blue-800 border-b pb-4\">Residential Localities</h3>\r\n<div class=\"h-64 overflow-y-auto text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 pr-4 space-y-2\">Station Road, Rajvant Palace Area, Darbar Road, Vadia Palace area, Harsiddhi Mata Road, Civil Hospital Road, Police Lines, Anand Nagar, Nilkanth Nagar, Gayatri Nagar, Patel Society, Vasant Society, New Court area, GIDC Rajpipla Housing.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-blue-800 border-b pb-4\">Narmada Regional Hubs</h3>\r\n<div class=\"h-64 overflow-y-auto text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 pr-4 space-y-2\">Kevadia (Statue of Unity Hub), Garudeshwar, Tilakwada, Dediapada, Sagbara, Narmada GIDC, Nandod, Moti-Rethali industrial belt.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- FAQ SECTION - 10 QUESTIONS -->\r\n\r\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\">\r\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 italic text-gray-900 text-center\">10 Critical AC Installation FAQs for Rajpipla</h2>\r\n<div class=\"space-y-4\"><!-- FAQ 1 --><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\" open=\"\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">Why is proper vacuuming critical for ACs near the Narmada river?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">The high humidity in Rajpipla can trap moisture in the lines during installation. This moisture reacts with refrigerant to form acid, destroying the compressor. Our <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/ac-service-rajpipla\">Rajpipla AC service</a> uses 500-micron vacuuming to ensure a moisture-free system.</p>\r\n\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 2 -->\r\n\r\n<details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">How long does a professional AC setup take?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">A technical installation in Rajpipla typically takes 2.5 to 3 hours, allowing for safe mounting and technical testing.</p>\r\n\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 3 -->\r\n\r\n<details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">Do you provide VRF/Central AC installation in Kevadia resorts?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Yes, we specialize in high-capacity <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-rajpipla\">Central AC installations</a> for the hospitality sector in the Kevadia and Statue of Unity region.</p>\r\n\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 4 -->\r\n\r\n<details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">What is the ideal height for indoor unit mounting in local homes?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Ideally, 7.5 to 8 feet from the floor for best air rotation and ease of future <a class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold underline\" href=\"/ac-repair-rajpipla\">repair</a> access.</p>\r\n\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 5 -->\r\n\r\n<details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">Do you offer a workmanship guarantee?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Yes, Atlas Aircon provides a 30-day installation guarantee for every job in Rajpipla. If any leak occurs, we fix it free.</p>\r\n\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 6 -->\r\n\r\n<details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">Can I reuse copper pipes from my old unit?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">We strongly recommend new <a class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/copper-pipe/\">copper piping</a> to avoid residue contamination, common in older R22 gas units.</p>\r\n\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 7 -->\r\n\r\n<details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">Is a heavy-duty MS stand necessary for outdoor units?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Yes. A heavy-duty <a class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/outdoor-stand/\">outdoor stand</a> is essential for safety, stability, and to reduce vibration noise in balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 8 -->\r\n\r\n<details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">Do you repair commercial deep freezers in Narmada?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Yes, our mobile teams handle commercial <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-rajpipla\">deep freezer repair</a> and industrial maintenance.</p>\r\n\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 9 -->\r\n\r\n<details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">What electrical wiring is required?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">A dedicated 16A socket and 4.0 sq mm <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/copper-wire/\">multi-strand wire</a> are essential for modern 5-star ACs.</p>\r\n\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 10 -->\r\n\r\n<details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">How often should I service my AC in Rajpipla?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">To maintain efficiency, a professional <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline font-semibold\" href=\"/ac-service-rajpipla\">service</a> is recommended every 4 months due to high humidity and dust levels.</p>\r\n\r\n</details></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- FINAL CTA -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"py-24 px-4 hero-gradient text-white text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-white\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-6 text-white\">Ready for 10/10 Cooling in Rajpipla?</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-blue-100 text-lg mb-10 text-white\">Experience the difference of technical precision. Trust the engineering experts for your home or business.</p>\r\n<a class=\"inline-block bg-white text-blue-900 px-12 py-5 rounded-2xl font-black text-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transform hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-2xl\" href=\"tel:+919727257141\">\r\n<i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt mr-2\"></i> Book Rajpipla Installation Now\r\n</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</section>",
